OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club holds silence for   
OL,4,Aabuse victims                          
OL,6,FThe club's general manager Gary Hake   
OL,7,Fsaid the gesture was "a way of making  
OL,8,Feverybody slow down for a minute to    
OL,9,Fthink about what the White Ribbon      
OL,10,Fcampaign actually is and how people can
OL,11,Fhelp".                                 
